**File:** `orchestrator.py`
Confirmed unused by `_classify_agent()`'s actual routing flow. Since the old orchestrator keeps running unmodified until cutover (per the build-alongside plan), no need to touch it now. The new single-agent core doesn't need an equivalent — its stance/domain-tag scoring (Section 6.3) does this job with plain keyword scoring, no LLM call.

